# Generated schema skill packs and digests. These name internal servers,
# databases, tables and columns, and this repository is public. The generator
# writes them outside the repository by default and refuses to write into
# skills/, mcp/ or docs/ at all; these entries cover the in-repo escape hatch.
# See skills/claude-skills/sql-server-schema/references/pii-and-public-repo-safety.md
